@startuml
title Test #14: 错误时状态不变（atomic）

object "Before" as ib {
  internalStore:
    $r0 = "pre-existing"  ← 哨兵
}

object "After" as ia {
  internalStore:
    $r0 = "pre-existing"  ← 哨兵未变
}

ib ..> ia : executeMove(\n  from={internal, name:'$missing'}\n  to  ={internal, name:'$r0'}\n) ✗ AddressError

note right of ia
  **验证（一条核心断言）**
  internalStore.get('$r0')
    === 'pre-existing' ✓
  resolve 失败 → write 永远不执行
end note

@enduml
